    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/pastry-shop/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Pastry Shop Theme is a delightful and versatile solution crafted for Pastry Shops looking to present their sweet creations online with style and professionalism. Perfect for Bakeries showcasing artisanal breads, gourmet pastries, and daily baked goods, it also caters to Cake Shops and Custom Cake Designers who want to highlight wedding cakes, celebration cakes, and personalized designs. Confectioneries and Chocolatiers can feature handcrafted chocolates, truffles, and seasonal treats, while Sweet Shops and Cupcake Shops benefit from sections dedicated to signature desserts, seasonal specials, and gift boxes. Dessert Cafés and Patisseries can use the theme to display elegant menu offerings, seasonal pastry collections, and café specials, while Artisan Bread Makers can highlight sourdoughs, baguettes, and specialty loaves with high-quality images and detailed descriptions. With integrated online ordering plugins, flexible layout customization, product galleries, and options for personalization, the theme supports smooth eCommerce operations, subscription boxes, dessert catering, and delivery services. Interactive menus, featured item displays, and dedicated areas for gluten-free or vegan treats enhance the browsing experience, while responsive design, SEO optimization, and fast loading ensure that your bakery, pastry, or dessert brand reaches more customers and grows effectively online."
    },
